📄 .gitignore File — AI-PORT-X (Complete & Production-Safe)
Bhai, ye tera complete .gitignore hai — Python + Node + React + Database + IDE + OS sab cover karta hai. Isse Gemini API key leak nahi hogi aur junk files push nahi hongi. 🔥

📝 .gitignore (Copy-Paste Ready)
gitignore
# ============================================
# 🚀 AI-PORT-X - .gitignore
# ============================================

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🔐 ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (CRITICAL - NEVER PUSH)
