| Metric | Improvement |
|--------|-------------|
| ⚡ Vessel Turnaround Time | **~40% faster** |
| ⚡ Idle Crane Hours | **~35% reduction** |
| ⚡ Customs Clearance | **~50% faster** |
| ⚡ Warehouse Utilization | **~30% improvement** |
| ⚡ Real-Time Visibility | **100% coverage** |

